{"product_id":"love-notes-from-vinegar-house","title":"Love Notes from Vinegar House","description":"\u003cp\u003eThere Are Some Things You Should Know About Me If We Are Going To Be Friends. Like I Don’t Believe In Ghosts.” Freya Jackson Kramer Has Done Some Stupid Things Before, But This Is The First Time They’ve Been Splashed Across Facebook. When She Escapes To Vinegar House For The Holidays, She Thinks She’s Leaving Her Troubles Behind. But Freya’s Troubles Are Just Beginning. How Will She Deal With Her Manipulative Cousin, Rumer? How Can She Avoid The Ex-love Of Her Life, Luke Hart? And What Secrets Lie In The Locked Attic?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 132 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Karen Tayleur\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781742032191\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 250\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45807554003097,"sku":"17RB-4-9781742032191","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f6304cb1c24_Love_Notes_from_Vinegar_House_Karen_Tayleur.jpg?v=1760972535","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/love-notes-from-vinegar-house","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}